### POST to create a thread - it should return { "threadReference": "ABCD12345" }  with status DRAFT
POST http://localhost:4999/sdec-ipaas-stub/api/v1/thread
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pid": "1001",
    "team": "Child_Benefit"
}

